    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Make Mischief and Challenge Authority</p></blockquote><p>The Trickery Domain offers magic of deception, illusion, and stealth. Its Clerics are a disruptive force: they puncture pride, mock tyrants, free captives, and flout empty traditions, preferring subterfuge and pranks to open confrontation.</p><p>Gods of trickery are mischief-makers and instigators who challenge the established order among gods and mortals alike. They embody change and social upheaval and are patrons of thieves, scoundrels, gamblers, rebels, and liberators; secret religious orders working against oppressive powers also draw on this domain.</p><h3>Trickery Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FqZ6dDCN6GbLS1bx]{Blessing of the Trickster}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.euikauYcLAVnj5Ju]{Trickery Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.XCDS7nlNfNBnUjzq]{Invoke Duplicity}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.vi29WpTlClaFcuVl]{Trickster's Transposition}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.JdXaBth6kzPeBg3T]{Improved Duplicity}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Trickery Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCharmPerso]{Charm Person}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDisguiseSe]{Disguise Self}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplInvisibili]{Invisibility}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPasswithou]{Pass without Trace}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHypnoticPa]{Hypnotic Pattern}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplNondetecti]{Nondetection}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConfusion0]{Confusion}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDimensionD]{Dimension Door}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDominatePe]{Dominate Person}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplModifyMemo]{Modify Memory}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
